{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39957","headline":"将入城灵口道中作 · 徐夤","name":"将入城灵口道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路上长安惟咫尺，灞陵西望接秦源。\n依稀日下分天阙，隐映云边是国门。\n锦袖臂鹰河北客，青桑鸣雉渭南村。\n高风九万程途近，与报沧洲欲化鲲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}